    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Borders\r\n\r\nNotice that there is a new section of our webpage called `<style>`. This defines the rules for how the webpage should look.\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand borders and add new `border` styles to our webpage.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Ask AI Tutor to explain how the `border` rule works\r\n    - You can send AI Tutor a message directly, or highlight the code and select \"Add to AI Tutor\"\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to add a border to each `section` on this page. \r\n    - Use specific language, like \"`<border>`\" or \"border style and color\", to make sure AI follows your vision.\r\n\r\nOnce you've added borders to the sections: press the Continue button!",
