        "buildCSS": "- ONLY add styles to the `<style>` tag in the head of the document. Follow the pattern already in the index.html file.\n- Do not use relative units for spacing; only use px.\n- Focus on the CSS tags emphasized in this level; do not add additional tags unless explicitly asked to.",
